{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hi Maria, since we last chatted, I'm volunteering as a mentor for a local school. It's really rewarding to see how much I can help these students."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-3f91cb017aa6068520b3952f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.501254+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3f91cb017aa6068520b3952f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3f91cb017aa6068520b3952f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John! You're doing great things. Kudos for helping kids learn. On another note, I just adopted this cute pup from a shelter last week. She brings so much joy! I feel blessed to be able to give her a home."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-cf3aee21e336dc15ea288e06", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.529339+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cf3aee21e336dc15ea288e06", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cf3aee21e336dc15ea288e06", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria, how cute! What's her name? Do she and your other dog get along?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-6a918cd7825b33deab4d6671", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.552112+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6a918cd7825b33deab4d6671", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6a918cd7825b33deab4d6671", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Her name is Shadow! She's full of energy and always puts a smile on my face. She's been a great addition to my life. They get along great."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-fc5caee276a70478c020cd5f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.570150+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fc5caee276a70478c020cd5f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fc5caee276a70478c020cd5f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Aww, that sounds adorable! Animals really bring a lot of joy and love, don't they? Did you have any pets growing up?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-9de2a8a614f15ec19047d6c9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.591848+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9de2a8a614f15ec19047d6c9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9de2a8a614f15ec19047d6c9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: No, I didn't. But having a furry pal definitely brightens my days."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-7d98bcecbd5de951714b7ca2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.611786+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7d98bcecbd5de951714b7ca2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7d98bcecbd5de951714b7ca2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: They sure do! I'll have to look into shelters near me soon, it would be great to have a new pup in the house."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-5de1dac3e55f35a21aac7f49", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.626280+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5de1dac3e55f35a21aac7f49", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5de1dac3e55f35a21aac7f49", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah, John! Pets are great at making you feel loved. It's awesome having them around, they bring so much joy! How's everything going with the mentoring program? Are the students making progress?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-67671f422de1c4ceff4f0375", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.643794+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "67671f422de1c4ceff4f0375", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "67671f422de1c4ceff4f0375", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: They're doing great - there's been a real improvement in their confidence and skills. It was so amazing to see one of them last week, so excited to show me their essay. It was a proud moment! How's your new pup doing, Maria?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-2a32887dd3c79ec20ca1e6c1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.665985+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2a32887dd3c79ec20ca1e6c1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2a32887dd3c79ec20ca1e6c1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Awesome, John! Sounds like it's really making a difference. The little one is doing great - learning commands and house training."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-89c4ebfaef0d3e0f5bc16fd3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.690348+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "89c4ebfaef0d3e0f5bc16fd3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "89c4ebfaef0d3e0f5bc16fd3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, cool Maria! Your little one is so smart and keen to learn, must be awesome!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-961cd2f105247bf6bbb37347", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.707183+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "961cd2f105247bf6bbb37347", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "961cd2f105247bf6bbb37347", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: She's an amazing learner - so much fun to work with and watch her grow. She's brought me so much joy!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-25ad6a7226dc3509ad7a9602", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.724012+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "25ad6a7226dc3509ad7a9602", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "25ad6a7226dc3509ad7a9602", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Animals are amazing\u2014 They can be incredible companions."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-ba5d28f4814fb238e120e7e1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.738417+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ba5d28f4814fb238e120e7e1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ba5d28f4814fb238e120e7e1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah, they can really comfort us and make us feel understood in ways others can't. It's amazing how they bring us so much happiness."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-36125a23f94f9a4d37341535", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.760557+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "36125a23f94f9a4d37341535", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "36125a23f94f9a4d37341535", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, animals bring us peace and understanding, plus we can always count on them. That's so priceless."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-4abcad1565398b04795f50f2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.777195+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4abcad1565398b04795f50f2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4abcad1565398b04795f50f2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Absolutely, John. They're always there for us."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-6d67122b9a789adbc2406a3d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.795516+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6d67122b9a789adbc2406a3d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6d67122b9a789adbc2406a3d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, my family is awesome - me, the missus, and the kids. Even when times are hard, they always have my back. Best thing ever, really."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-56c55765aa92585560832770", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.808390+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "56c55765aa92585560832770", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "56c55765aa92585560832770", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: That picture is so cute! What activities do you all enjoy doing together?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-4baea3ba56463b5f5c287283", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.824964+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4baea3ba56463b5f5c287283", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4baea3ba56463b5f5c287283", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! We love being outdoors - going for hikes, hanging out at the park, having picnics - plus playing board games and having movie nights at home."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-52825b466869a43064c848fb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.840805+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "52825b466869a43064c848fb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "52825b466869a43064c848fb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Sounds like a blast, John! Spending time with family is so important, and that all sounds perfect. Have a great time!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-eb18d8ee9664b709728f6515", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.858007+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "eb18d8ee9664b709728f6515", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "eb18d8ee9664b709728f6515", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! I'm off to spend some time with them now. Have a good day!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-3323af8b678f4e25fa34901a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.869548+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3323af8b678f4e25fa34901a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3323af8b678f4e25fa34901a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Enjoy your family time, John! Have a great day!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-a352392812ab34e55c8a9849", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.892967+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a352392812ab34e55c8a9849", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a352392812ab34e55c8a9849", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! You too! Stay safe!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_31-73e4ccb30fb359a1ce8f640a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:11.908338+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "73e4ccb30fb359a1ce8f640a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "73e4ccb30fb359a1ce8f640a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
